      408.35,
      286.55,
      532.38
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: Kadu/06/2/3/73 Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: 4-3/06/2012/HW/389. IT is hereby give notice that the final date for the submission of documents Pertaining to Title claims and compensation inquiries to the lands depicted in P. P. Co. 9406 mentioned in the Extraordinary Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic in Sri Lanka bearing number 1903/57 dated 27th February 2015, under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended on 01st April, 2015.",
