  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      696.65,
      286.54,
      739.08
    ],
    "text": "My. Reference. No.: Biya/3/1/1/227. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      1.9800000190734863,
      4.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.25,
      539.49,
      369.14
    ],
    "text": "Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      368.77,
      539.46,
      464.94
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: An allotment of land total extent of 0.2923 Hectare depicted in the P.P. Gam 3520 as Lot No. 1 prepared by the District superintendent of surveys on 26.03.2006 situated in the village of Pattivila in Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of 279A Pattivila South in Adhikari Pattu Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Biyagama in Gampaha District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      465.21,
      539.47,
      511.5
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Pattivila Urban Council Land; Description: Open Waste Land; Earlier Claimant: Municipal Council-Colombo; Extent: 0.2923 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      511.93,
      539.5,
      637.98
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Biyagama on the 10 day of June 2015, at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th May, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      638.14,
      521.81,
      686.18
    ],
